                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-10536**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | libcurl4t64  | 8.14.1-2+deb13u5  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:13  | [CVE-2026-10536](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-10536)  |\n"
