            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-82209-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-82209 high vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When libpsl support is enabled, libcurl fails to enforce the Public Suffix List boundary check when processing a `Set-Cookie` header where the `Domain` attribute explicitly matches an origin host that is itself a public suffix (e.g., `Domain=co.uk` set by `co.uk`).  Instead of coercing it into a strict host-only cookie, libcurl saves the cookie with wildcard domain scope (`.co.uk`). Consequently, the cookie is inappropriately included in subsequent outbound requests or HTTP redirects to arbitrary sibling subdomains under the same public suffix (e.g., `attacker.co.uk`)."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-82209",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-82209\nSeverity: high\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 8.14.1-2+deb13u5\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:13\nLink: [CVE-2026-82209](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-82209)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-82209**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | curl  | 8.14.1-2+deb13u5  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:13  | [CVE-2026-82209](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-82209)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/curl@8.14.1-2%2Bdeb13u5?arch=amd64\u0026distro=debian-13.7"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.2"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-82209-libcurl4t64",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-82209 high vulnerability for libcurl4t64 package"
