            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-15649-perl-base",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-15649 medium vulnerability for perl-base package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "IO::Uncompress::Unzip versions before 2.215 for Perl propagate uncaught exception when parsing zip header with malformed DOS date.  _dosToUnixTime() decodes the local-file-header last-modification date field and calls Time::Local::timelocal() without an eval guard. A header whose date field decodes to an out-of-range month, day, or hour causes timelocal() to die.  The exception propagates out of IO::Uncompress::Unzip-\u003enew($file) where callers expect undef plus $UnzipError."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2025-15649",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-15649\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: perl-base\nVersion: 5.40.1-6+deb13u1\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:13\nLink: [CVE-2025-15649](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2025-15649)",
